Description: wwan: the modem details show the serving and neighbour cells
 Modem Details showed the operator, the access technology and a signal
 percentage, nothing of the cell the modem is on.  Two groups are added,
 filled in from ModemManager's cell info every few seconds while the dialog
 is shown: the serving cell -- band, channel, PCI, cell id, TAC, bandwidth,
 RSRP, RSRQ, SINR -- and the neighbour cells.  ModemManager reports the
 channel, not the band: the band is looked up from it (NR bands overlap; the
 ones used in China win), the TAC of an NR cell comes from the 3GPP location,
 and an LTE cell's SINR from the Signal interface.
